    rdfs:label 'Hedis Result Id' ;
    rdfs:comment 'Foreign key linking to care.hedis_result. Business justification: Care gaps are frequently identified from HEDIS measure results — when a member fails to meet a numerator criterion, a gap is opened. Linking gap to hedis_result establishes the traceability from the m' ;
